{"1695423658334847470":{"a":"<p>Oh man that takes me back to field day in the 90s. AB9D would get a weather balloon and hydrogen generator and setup about a 300ft vertical wire like this. It could be a little dangerous to use because it would begin to arc over when lightning was within a few dozen miles. <a href=\"https://x.com/cqcqcqdx/status/1695234856681107596\">Tweet by @cqcqcqdx</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/cqcqcqdx/status/1695234856681107596\">https://x.com/cqcqcqdx/status/1695234856681107596</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1695423658334847470</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1695423658334847470\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-26T13:11:14Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1695424441033859096":{"a":"<p>@cqcqcqdx Local hams used these for field day in my youth. They worked well but lightning was a serious danger. You&#x27;d start getting arcing around a hundred miles out from a thunderstorm. They were also dangerous to aircraft so we notified local ATC as well</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/cqcqcqdx/status/1695234856681107596\">https://x.com/cqcqcqdx/status/1695234856681107596</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1695424441033859096</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1695424441033859096\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-26T13:14:20Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1695552144118616076":{"a":"<p>🤦‍♂️ <a href=\"https://x.com/jeriellsworth/status/1695547422444044747\">Tweet by @jeriellsworth</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/jeriellsworth/status/1695547422444044747\">https://x.com/jeriellsworth/status/1695547422444044747</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1695552144118616076</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1695552144118616076\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-08-26T21:41:47Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>art</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}